{"id":832,"date":"2025-05-20T18:34:19","date_gmt":"2025-05-20T13:04:19","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/kaveriuniversity.edu.in\/?page_id=832"},"modified":"2025-11-08T09:56:29","modified_gmt":"2025-11-08T04:26:29","slug":"library","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/kaveriuniversity.edu.in\/library\/","title":{"rendered":"Library"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"832\" class=\"elementor elementor-832\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-ec9bc61 elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"ec9bc61\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-narrow\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-f4f7ed4\" data-id=\"f4f7ed4\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3705f2c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3705f2c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Knowledge Management Centre (KMC)<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-42f0382 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"42f0382\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>The main objective is to enhance the quality of Agricultural and Technical Education. KMC has fostered a conducive learning environment and, with its excellent IT infrastructure, has established distinct academic support facilities. The library features a centrally air-conditioned reading hall, offering a congenial space for students and staff to engage in meaningful academic pursuits.<\/div><div>In addition to its ambient setting, the library houses a rich collection of printed books, national and international journals, newspapers, and magazines. It also provides access to a wide range of e-books and e-journals through platforms such as J-Gate, ensuring seamless access to scholarly content across disciplines.<\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-d6498cb elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-content-middle elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"d6498cb\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-45132e6\" data-id=\"45132e6\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-979ace0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"979ace0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Mission<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e5bbbad elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e5bbbad\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The primary objective is to develop the KMC Library into a highly effective Knowledge Management Centre that contributes significantly to the quality of higher education in Agricultural Sciences and Engineering and Technology. To enhance the learning environment, the library has established an Online Public Access Catalogue (OPAC) search area and subscribed to the J-Gate service for global access to e-journals. It also features a dedicated laptop zone equipped with Wi-Fi connectivity<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4ce6822 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4ce6822\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Features<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-edf3c3a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"edf3c3a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The library has also created learning environment by establishing Online Public Access Catalogue (OPAC) Searching Area and a Laptop Zone with Wi-Fi facility.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d3b9dee elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"d3b9dee\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Membership<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3706103 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3706103\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Membership is open to the following categories:<\/p><ul><li>Members of the Board of Management,Academic council and such other persons as may be designated honorary members by the managament\/Vice-Chancellor.<\/li><li>Members of the various facilities (Teaching, Reseach and Extension ) in the Kaveri University.<\/li><li>University staff.<\/li><li>Students of Kaveri University.<\/li><li>Such other persons as may be permitted by the Librarian.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-916fac0 elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"916fac0\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-bc1ca66\" data-id=\"bc1ca66\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e9a901c elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"e9a901c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"601\" height=\"401\" src=\"https:\/\/kaveriuniversity.edu.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Untitled-design-32.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-835\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kaveriuniversity.edu.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Untit