\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f386ece elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f386ece\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li>Internet facility is secured and the access is available only for the regular members of university only.<\/li><li>Corporate members and other visiting scholars cannot access internet and e-resources because they will not be provided Internet ID\/Password.<\/li><li>Users are advised to make use of this facility only to support their academic and research activities.<\/li><li>Users should not use USB devices \/ pen drives for data transfer to avoid the entry of computer virus,such file\/data transfer cand be done as e-mail attachements.<\/li><li>It is our collective responsibility, as far as the safety of the systems is concerned. Please bring to the notice of the Librarian for any misuse of the systems.<\/li><li style=\"text-align: left;\">Librarian reserves the right to stop extending this facility to a person found misusing, apart from initiating action as per the rules by the University.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-3cb6d19 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"3cb6d19\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-d0b8f8d\" data-id=\"d0b8f8d\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2867458 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"2867458\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Internet Based Services<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5811434 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5811434\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Library is providing Internet based services and tools &#8211; Online Public Access Catalogue (OPAC), e-resources, browsing area, Wi-Fi<\/strong><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-d79fb6e elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"d79fb6e\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-4e1d2cc\" data-id=\"4e1d2cc\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d3e7e49 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"d3e7e49\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" src=\"https:\/\/kaveriuniversity.edu.in\/wp-content\/uploads